 "remarks": "** Public record failed to count the 2nd story 755 sq ft ( approx) ** This house has 2 bedroom suites with attached bathrooms!  Main level has family room, one bedroom suite w/ private entrance and updated bathroom, sitting area. From the foyer, walk up a few steps to an open floor-plan living room, dining room & updated kitchen with large granite island. This area has sliders to deck for easy entertaining. The living room is flooded with light from the large windows. Main level also has a sunroom with cedar ceiling, flooring & hot tub. Hot tub is currently not functional & is covered over with a platform. It was used as a playroom. Upstairs has 3 bedrooms, including another primary suite with updated bathroom (2023), as well as updated hall bath (2019) . All hardwood floors have been refinished & most of interior repainted on 2023. Full basement includes the laundry with new washer and dryer. Ample storage in basement, and in garage with pull up stairs. Large 2-car garage. Other improvements within the last 10 years include: Roof(2019), gas heating system, hot water heater, all bathrooms were renovated, Central AC (2024), Central exhaust system (2024), Kitchen was updated with brand new disposal system (2025) and Kitchen Faucet w/ Pull Down Sprayer (2026), Front was decorated with stones in 2024. Shed and sunroom. Never had flooding issues in basement. Great neighborhood.  Great school district with magnet schools option. **",
